message: "If you use this data or these rules in research or a report, please cite it as below."
title: "India Threat Tracker"
abstract: >-
  Open threat intelligence for India: actively exploited vulnerabilities
  prioritised for Indian organisations, fraud campaigns with indicators,
  state-nexus actors, ransomware and hacktivist activity, detection rules, and
  machine-readable feeds (JSON, STIX 2.1, MISP).
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Sohan Kanna"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sohankanna/india-threat-tracker"
url: "https://www.sohankanna.com/tracker"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - threat intelligence
  - India
  - CISA KEV
  - detection engineering
  - STIX
  - MISP
